# Antigravity Workflow Authentication Configuration
# You can choose either option below:

# OPTION 1: Google AI Studio (Recommended for simplicity)
# The AI Studio API has a free tier that does not charge anything for standard usage.
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/api-keys
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# OPTION 2: Vertex AI (Recommended if you want to use your GCP/Google developer credentials)
# This will utilize Google Cloud Application Default Credentials (ADC).
# To use:
# 1. Run in your terminal: gcloud auth application-default login
# 2. Uncomment and configure the variables below:
# USE_VERTEX=True
# GCP_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
# GCP_LOCATION=us-central1
